BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 535.75 Td (1. Print on plain printer paper, not card. Cut along the dashed lines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 525.83 Td (2. Write your phone number on the strip. Scan the code, or visit straycats.love/c, to learn more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 515.91 Td (    If the cat is in the StrayCats app, write its ID on the strip.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 505.98 Td (3. Only for a friendly cat you can handle easily. Never a nervous or feral cat, and not for kittens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 496.06 Td (4. Wrap it loosely around the neck: two fingers should slide under it easily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 486.14 Td (5. Overlap the ends and tape them together with one small piece of tape, paper to paper. Never tape the whole collar: plain paper tears if the collar) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 476.22 Td (    snags, but tape stops it tearing. No tape on fur.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 466.30 Td (6. Check on the cat, and take the collar off if it bothers them.) Tj ET
